{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-laya-heights","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"laya-heights-laya-dubai-studio-city","about":"Laya Heights is an elite 9-storey residential complex located in the commercial district of Dubai - Dubai Studio City. The facades of the building are designed in a modern style, the interiors are finished with natural high quality materials. Elegant studios and luxurious one-bedroom apartments are available for sale. The large windows and balconies of each residence offer mesmerising views of commercial facilities such as directors' and producers' houses, recording studios and a training centre for actors.On-site special amenities include an outdoor cinema, areas for various sports, a swimming pool with sun loungers, a children's playground, a sauna and landscaped recreational areas with barbecue facilities.A distinctive feature of the complex is its location. Opposite is the prestigious GEMS Metropole School, and within walking distance residents can find the Dubai Polo &amp; Equestrian Club. Dubai Hills Mall can be reached in 5 minutes, while the Mall of the Emirates, Dubai Mall and IMG World of Adventure theme park will take approximately 10-15 minutes to reach.Laya Heights offers its residents a self-sufficient and luxurious lifestyle, as well as ample space to work from home and socialise with the building's residents.","price":650000,"title":"Laya Heights","bitrix":{"id":732,"pf_id":"are.2.11963","source":null,"project_id":"Laya Heights","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Laya Heights","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"LAYA Developers","project_location":"Dubai Studio City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/397/images/2024/02/12/340x252/YLHpSmO7gbzANMF2xj8an3zp1mrVA0ruWe8izge4.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/397/images/2024/02/12/464x312/YLHpSmO7gbzANMF2xj8an3